{"id":"vod_sn_35968","vodId":"35968","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"最终兵器彼女","name_cn":"最终兵器彼女","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第13集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/98562f35dbeb1e2cdc83954087d4dacb.jpg"},"summary":"娇小害羞的千濑（前田亚季 饰）一直暗恋着同班同学修次（洼冢俊介 饰），终于，在鼓起勇气向修次表白之后，千濑和修次之间纯白的爱情之花绽放了。一天，札幌的上空突然飞来了大量的轰炸机，战争开始了，也就是从那时起，修次发现了深藏在千濑体内的秘密——向来人畜无害的千濑竟然被军方残忍的改造成为了“最终武器”。　　尽管心中充满了恐惧与不忍，但只要遭到了攻击，千濑的身体就会不受控制地做出自卫反击，就这样，在短暂的幸福之后，千濑绝望而又无助的，作为兵器的余生开始了。看着身体和心灵都千疮百孔的女友，修次无法说出宽慰之语，他只能通过行动，默默的陪伴在千濑的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i8Lzg0cLPU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c0VCSunjZ91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RUBQvvSSie1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tdZNxkgQRN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eMaMG2pXMH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Lc6wGiv8bc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Nq2na7nzXM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e5x5fgkNM51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iiJ9wiFPr61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cGPnGWvnBM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hVUjMswLm41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LEvCHFQhdV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/00R9uAZeCZ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:28.834Z"}